- Story & Context: Elara, the group's lead synth-tech, confessed to the others that she had been feeding her own heartbeat into the arcade motherboards to keep them running. She stood in the central atrium holding a smoldering, melted arcade token while the glass gongs vibrated her ribs into a state of semi-paralysis. She stared into the dark lens of a camera, whispering the hook "Is the coin still hot?" before realizing her own memory of the mall's grand opening was being slowly overwritten by the machine’s static.
